{"version":1,"content":"<p>前港姐季軍楊梓瑤（Amina）樣靚身材正，近日她在社交平台晒出一段拍攝靚相的影片，並配文寫道：「天使還是魔鬼？</p><p>Fallen Angel聽多了，這組墮落天使寫真，有沒有戳中你？</p><p>白緊身衣×巨大黑羽翼×長劍，反差感直接拉滿，一半純淨，一半桀驁。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:21:16.446350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T01:18:15.236843+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:18:15.236843+00:00","content_hash":"db9e4a81c72a0e673a959b560a3b97831bbe5b5502166e7726dc2b5227afb039","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}